    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup\n\n**1. Add one Lead Pool column:** `bounced_at`\n\n**2. Create the IMAP credential and select it on the trigger node** (it is intentionally left blank). Same mailbox your SMTP credential 'GFIN Email - James' sends from. Typical webmail/cPanel settings:\n- Host: `mail.yourdomain.com` (often same host as SMTP)\n- Port `993`, SSL/TLS on\n- Same user + password as SMTP\n\nName it **GFIN Email IMAP**.\n\n**3. Test** by emailing that address yourself, then activate.\n\n---\n\n### Why this exists\n\nM365 and Workspace accept every recipient at the edge and bounce later, so no pre-send check proves deliverability. **The bounce is the verification.**\n\n- Hard bounce (5.x.x) to `bounced` + `do_not_send`, permanently suppressed\n- Soft bounce (4.x.x) recorded, not suppressed\n- Human reply to `reply_text` + `replied_at` + status Replied\n- Auto-reply / OOO ignored\n\nAlso closes the reply-tracking gap: 806 LinkedIn touches, 0 replies recorded.",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 460
      },
